"""
main.py
───────
MCP server entry point — hosts multiple agent MCP sub-apps.

Currently registered sub-apps:
  /api/v1/voice_text_intake   — Voice/Text Intake (FNOL)
  /api/v1/policy_coverage     — Policy Coverage Verification

Run:
    source mcp_venv/bin/activate
    python main.py
